#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:3 9f406a9d9e09471e8c544de53bdd97a6
msgid "Long Commands"
msgstr "长指令"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:9 c20ca3c4cc3a4675a92d65e5c7513a9d
msgid ""
"This module is a collection of ``command_long_send`` functions that may be "
"useful to the user. It also adds the ``command_int`` function which allows "
"sending MAVLink COMMAND_INT messages."
msgstr ""
"该模块是一组可能对用户有用的 ``command_long_send`` 函数的集合。它还添加了 ``command_int`` 函数，用于发送 "
"MAVLink COMMAND_INT 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:14 387bec34fcc84d4f8c5945528eb63bd0
msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:20 568c746c357e445c8f35a8584e67d511
msgid ""
"If in automated flight mode, set the vehicles target speed to ``N`` m/s."
msgstr "若处于自动飞行模式，将飞行器目标速度设为 ``N`` 米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:27 6531dc120bed4c16b2dab735d0ff476b
msgid ""
"Set the target yaw of the vehicle to ``ANGLE`` (0-360), with a maximum "
"angular speed of ``ANGULAR_SPEED`` (deg/sec). ``MODE`` is either 0 (absolute"
" angle) or 1 (relative angle)."
msgstr ""
"将飞行器目标偏航设为 ``ANGLE`` （0-360），最大角速度为 ``ANGULAR_SPEED`` （度/秒）。``MODE`` 为 "
"0（绝对角度）或 1（相对角度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:34 f25ccba90bb94cc4a13db241b1420030
msgid ""
"Sends an automated takeoff command to the vehicle. It will consider the "
"takeoff finished at ``ALTITUDE_IN_METERS`` m (relative)."
msgstr "向飞行器发送自动起飞指令。飞行器将在相对高度 ``ALTITUDE_IN_METERS`` 米时认为起飞完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:41 1124596e8fe749a0b35cfad2380d989c
msgid ""
"Sets a desired vehicle velocity in a local north-east-down (x, y, z) "
"coordinate frame. All velocities in m/s."
msgstr "在本地北-东-下（x, y, z）坐标系中设置飞行器期望速度。所有速度单位为米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:48 b3a7c418cf3f404587400049b1677088
msgid ""
"Sets a desired vehicle position in a local north-east-down (x, y, z) "
"coordinate frame. All positions in m."
msgstr "在本地北-东-下（x, y, z）坐标系中设置飞行器期望位置。所有位置单位为米。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:55 3511e85f9f544b35b2ee15c07b5c83ee
msgid "Set the desired attitude of the vehicle in quaternion format."
msgstr "以四元数格式设置飞行器期望姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:61 3285f25d1d2d4b688131ac8a1106ca30
msgid ""
"Sets the target position according to the previous mouse click on the map "
"and the target velocity in North-East-Down format (m/s). Uses a global "
"frame."
msgstr "根据地图上的上次鼠标点击位置设置目标位置，并以北-东-下格式（米/秒）设置目标速度。使用全局坐标系。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:68 a5ec094d43bb4109bcbf67efbac67a8f
msgid "If in AUTO or GUIDED mode, pause the vehicle's travel."
msgstr "若处于 AUTO 或 GUIDED 模式，暂停飞行器行进。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:74 891523a2287a4198a118f019bd30ce85
msgid "If in AUTO or GUIDED mode, resume the vehicle's travel."
msgstr "若处于 AUTO 或 GUIDED 模式，恢复飞行器行进。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:77 25f6206646fd40eda26221ec3d58820f
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "相机"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:79 25cadb6a50874f79a8ca08a0c9056698
msgid ""
"Note the following commands are not processed by APM, rather they are meant "
"for a companion computer which controls the camera."
msgstr "注意以下命令不由 APM 处理，而是发送给控制相机的协同计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:85 0c82ee7b928d4f7d94d3e30609863dcf
msgid ""
"Send a MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL Mavlink message. Parameters are: "
"M1=Session control e.g. show/hide lens, M2=Zoom's absolute position, "
"M3=Zooming step value to offset zoom from the current position, M4=Focus "
"Locking, Unlocking or Re-locking, M5=Shooting Command, M6=Command Identity, "
"M7=Empty."
msgstr ""
"发送 MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL MAVLink "
"消息。参数说明：M1=会话控制（如显示/隐藏镜头），M2=变焦绝对位置，M3=相对当前位置的变焦步进值，M4=对焦锁定/解锁/重新锁定，M5=拍摄命令，M6=命令标识，M7=空。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:93 4eea8ee64d8c4e399e9868239d75e731
msgid "Send an old-style MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL shooting command."
msgstr "发送旧式 MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL 拍摄命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:99 e3e484394a02482e9d5678cb744bf03d
msgid ""
"Send a MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE Mavlink message. The Parameters are: "
"M1=Modes [P, TV, AV, M], M2=Shutter Speed, M3=F Stop number, M4=ISO Number, "
"M5=Exposure type, M6=Command Identity, M7=Main engine cut-off time before "
"camera trigger in seconds/10 (0 means no cut-off)."
msgstr ""
"发送 MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE MAVLink 消息。参数说明：M1=模式 [P, TV, AV, "
"M]，M2=快门速度，M3=光圈值，M4=ISO 值，M5=曝光类型，M6=命令标识，M7=相机触发前主引擎关闭时间（秒/10，0 表示不关闭）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:102 37eee2ee85f44ef0a1bf4ff1feb82d9f
msgid "Systems"
msgstr "系统"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:108 762e93f571ed43348976496238302bdb
msgid ""
"Sends an action to the parachute. ``ACTION`` can be enable, disable or "
"release."
msgstr "向降落伞发送动作指令。``ACTION`` 可为 enable（启用）、disable（禁用）或 release（释放）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:116 39b4f587118c4c5da792bd171860703d
msgid ""
"Sends an engine control command (MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL). It can start or"
" stop the engine. Otherwise the full set of options can be specified, with "
"M1=1 or 0 for engine start/stop, M2=   0: Warm start, 1:Cold start. Controls"
" use of choke where applicable, M3=Height delay (meters). This is for "
"commanding engine start only after the vehicle has gained the specified "
"height."
msgstr ""
"发送引擎控制命令（MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL）。可启动或停止引擎。或者指定完整参数集：M1=1 或 0 "
"表示引擎启动/停止，M2=0 表示热启动，1 表示冷启动（控制阻风门的使用），M3=高度延迟（米），仅在飞行器达到指定高度后才命令引擎启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:123 0dd262150e4943f6a8ee01a802aec98b
msgid ""
"Send a general MAV_CMD_LONG message to the vehicle. ``COMMAND`` is the name "
"of the command. The options follow in ``[arg1] [arg2] ...`` format."
msgstr ""
"向飞行器发送通用 MAV_CMD_LONG 消息。``COMMAND`` 为命令名称，选项以 ``[arg1] [arg2] ...`` 格式跟随。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:130 945ea8f65a38496dbc1690b48391c0c8
msgid ""
"Send a general MAV_COMMAND_INT message to the vehicle ``COMMAND`` is the "
"name of the command prefixed with ``MAV_``. e.g. "
"MAV_CMD_GUIDED_CHANGE_HEADING. The options follow separated by spaces."
msgstr ""
"向飞行器发送通用 MAV_COMMAND_INT 消息。``COMMAND`` 是带 ``MAV_`` 前缀的命令名称，例如 "
"MAV_CMD_GUIDED_CHANGE_HEADING。选项在其后以空格分隔。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:133 e4b93db8b8794b7789bb0a61209e98dd
msgid "[arg1] target system"
msgstr "[arg1] 目标系统"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:134 bee2c85e042d4bea820c4f7ddc601658
msgid "[arg2] target component"
msgstr "[arg2] 目标组件"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:135 ff8dcb71b89d4621a15525adf25aca1d
msgid "[arg3] param1"
msgstr "[arg3] param1"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:136 b4cfd2cbbb56480a9dee5bd25c0932e8
msgid "[arg5] param2"
msgstr "[arg5] param2"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:137 a55ea82ac6d44890a57143da73bf74df
msgid "[arg6] param3"
msgstr "[arg6] param3"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:138 c7b20196295a41d8a9f84aad28dd690a
msgid "[arg7] param4"
msgstr "[arg7] param4"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:139 bbd5951a9d294e86903e7bddc5e82a48
msgid "[arg8] param5"
msgstr "[arg8] param5"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:140 32e06066258440308c0d4ef3470ede17
msgid "[arg9] latitude"
msgstr "[arg9] 纬度"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:141 777f024c777048d7823130a9920b2539
msgid "[arg10] longitude"
msgstr "[arg10] 经度"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:142 bf31368cf26c439f8301ed70708d4752
msgid "[arg11] altitude (in the frame specified by FRAME)"
msgstr "[arg11] 高度（在 FRAME 指定的坐标系中）"
